  "description": "Added a My Races page that gathers every race you saved on this device, grouped into Signed up, Considering and Interested, with each race's next registration milestone, weeks to train, an editable note, and a notice when a race's registration status has changed since you saved it. Races that are no longer listed show a notice with a remove button, and the page handles loading, empty and failed-to-load states. Scope verdict: this cycle DELIVERED the 'My Races view with upcoming races, registration milestones, notes and status changes' deliverable (previously deferred; approved by the user at the demo and save check-ins). Still DEFERRED by user decision: sort options and reminders. Known gaps, disclosed at approval: races saved before this update never show the 'changed since you saved' notice, and the race-summary lookup has no real-database test. The My Races scenarios now use dates relative to today, so what they show stays the same as the calendar moves on.",
